  "overview": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "attribution": "FDA",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "45eca458b4c9706cb6cf62ef9761b3a544206ee8defe3927503f6c75364ab586",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-45eca458b4c9-0000-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 2,
              "start": 2
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "In 2016, the FDA decided that e\u2011cigarettes and related products were new tobacco products subject to the Tobacco Control Act."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "45eca458b4c9706cb6cf62ef9761b3a544206ee8defe3927503f6c75364ab586",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-45eca458b4c9-0001-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 12,
              "start": 12
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Supreme Court held that retailers are \u201cadversely affected\u201d by a denial order and are proper petitioners under \u00a7\u202f387l(a)(1) of the Tobacco Control Act."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "45eca458b4c9706cb6cf62ef9761b3a544206ee8defe3927503f6c75364ab586",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-45eca458b4c9-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 11,
              "start": 11
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court noted that no court had ever held that an agency is \u201cadversely affected\u201d or \u201caggrieved\u201d under the APA."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Jackson",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "45eca458b4c9706cb6cf62ef9761b3a544206ee8defe3927503f6c75364ab586",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-45eca458b4c9-0001-0006"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Jackson (dissent) defined the \u201czone\u2011of\u2011interest test\u201d as a guide for deciding whether a plaintiff can challenge an agency decision."
      }
    ],
    "heading": "Overview",
    "status": "complete",
    "summary": null,
    "summary_citations": []
  },
  "party_positions": [
    {
      "claims": [
        {
          "attribution": "FDA",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "45eca458b4c9706cb6cf62ef9761b3a544206ee8defe3927503f6c75364ab586",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-45eca458b4c9-0001-0002"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 13,
                "start": 13
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "The FDA argues that the Tobacco Control Act is concerned exclusively with manufacturers, placing retailers outside the statute\u2019s zone of interest."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "FDA",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "45eca458b4c9706cb6cf62ef9761b3a544206ee8defe3927503f6c75364ab586",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-45eca458b4c9-0001-0003"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 14,
                "start": 14
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "The FDA contends that \u00a7\u202f387l(a)(1) applies not only to denial orders under \u00a7\u202f387j(c) but also to regulations promulgated under \u00a7\u202f387g."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "FDA",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "45eca458b4c9706cb6cf62ef9761b3a544206ee8defe3927503f6c75364ab586",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-45eca458b4c9-0001-0004"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 16,
                "start": 16
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "The FDA maintains that each petitioner in a joint petition for review must independently establish venue."
        }
      ],
      "heading": "FDA Position",
      "status": "complete",
      "summary": null,
      "summary_citations": []
    }
